WEBVTT

1
00:02:19.625 --> 00:02:21.684
Go secure the crystal!

2
00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:23.458
Hmm.

3
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.125
At this rate. we won't get there in time.

4
00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:42.083
This way!

5
00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:48.292
What do we do?

6
00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:53.768
<i>The crystal's installation is complete.</i>

7
00:02:53.792 --> 00:02:58.667
<i>and the final calibrations
on the cannon are already underway.</i>

8
00:03:23.042 --> 00:03:25.809
<i>Everyone aim
for the center of the kyber cannon.</i>

9
00:03:25.833 --> 00:03:28.832
Come on. there's no time to waste!

10
00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.768
Don't let them anywhere near the fortress.

11
00:03:33.792 --> 00:03:35.917
Annihilate them damn rocks!

12
00:03:46.208 --> 00:03:48.125
I won't let you stop us!

13
00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:24.809
There's too much counter-fire.
we can't get in closer.

14
00:04:24.833 --> 00:04:28.226
Kara. Ethan. come in. what's your status?

15
00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.018
Can you destroy the cannon?

16
00:04:30.042 --> 00:04:33.917
<i>Ethan. Ethan!
Can you hear me?</i>

17
00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:36.059
Yeah. yeah. I copy.

18
00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:39.018
Bad news. We haven't even reached
the command center.

19
00:04:39.042 --> 00:04:40.601
<i>Keep at it.</i>

20
00:04:40.625 --> 00:04:43.101
<i>We'll attack the turret regardless.</i>

21
00:04:43.125 --> 00:04:45.434
Kwana. focus your attack
on the power unit!

22
00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:47.726
What? Wait. But if we do that...

23
00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.643
<i>If we make them crash
onto Hy Izlan.</i>

24
00:04:49.667 --> 00:04:51.976
<i>it will disable the cannon
and buy us time. right?</i>

25
00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.643
That would work in theory.
but what about you?

26
00:04:54.667 --> 00:04:56.226
You don't have to worry about us.

27
00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.851
We'll figure something out!

28
00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:00.518
Four-Nines. get us out of here.

29
00:05:00.542 --> 00:05:02.832
Use autopilot
to remotely control the ships.

30
00:05:06.542 --> 00:05:09.041
I'm sure
young Kara can handle herself.

31
00:05:13.208 --> 00:05:16.018
<i>All right. you rogues.</i>

32
00:05:16.042 --> 00:05:17.893
<i>Our target has changed.</i>

33
00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:19.226
<i>Blow the engines.</i>

34
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:22.601
<i>we're gonna take that whole
floating junk heap down.</i>

35
00:05:22.625 --> 00:05:23.851
- Roger that!
- Roger that!

36
00:05:23.875 --> 00:05:24.957
Yep. Roger.

37
00:05:56.875 --> 00:05:59.250
We did what we could. Kara!

38
00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:00.958
Kara!

39
00:06:02.208 --> 00:06:04.208
The rest is up to you.

40
00:06:32.958 --> 00:06:35.726
I thought you said
you were gonna figure something out?

41
00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.292
I'm working on it.

42
00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:48.393
Whoa.

43
00:06:48.417 --> 00:06:50.500
The Force is so strong with her.

44
00:07:05.708 --> 00:07:07.309
<i>Damage to main engine.</i>

45
00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:09.708
<i>Emergency landing on Hy Izlan.</i>

46
00:07:10.542 --> 00:07:13.917
Redirect power to the control thrusters.

47
00:07:20.042 --> 00:07:21.667
<i>Continuing descent.</i>

48
00:07:45.167 --> 00:07:47.393
All right. we may have survived.

49
00:07:47.417 --> 00:07:49.643
but that wasn't
as much damage as we'd hoped.

50
00:07:49.667 --> 00:07:50.667
Nawaam...

51
00:07:56.917 --> 00:07:58.667
Any damage to the kyber cannon?

52
00:07:59.625 --> 00:08:01.458
No functional damage detected.

53
00:08:02.375 --> 00:08:05.559
Then we fire
as soon as preparations are complete.

54
00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:08.976
And we use it
to take out their defensive fleet.

55
00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.059
Our own forces
will be in the line of fire.

56
00:08:12.083 --> 00:08:13.851
That's irrelevant.

57
00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:15.018
Understood.

58
00:08:15.042 --> 00:08:16.268
Preparing to fire.

59
00:08:16.292 --> 00:08:17.958
Charging the kyber cannon.

60
00:08:22.875 --> 00:08:24.393
<i>Preparing to fire.</i>

61
00:08:24.417 --> 00:08:26.476
<i>Charging the kyber cannon.</i>

62
00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:27.893
<i>Preparing to fire...</i>

63
00:08:27.917 --> 00:08:30.559
Look. Lord Dunbai. Lady Tafflah.

64
00:08:30.583 --> 00:08:32.976
They're already
preparing to fire the cannon.

65
00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.851
Get your ships as far away as possible.

66
00:08:34.875 --> 00:08:36.643
That's not an option.

67
00:08:36.667 --> 00:08:38.101
It's too destructive a weapon.

68
00:08:38.125 --> 00:08:41.143
If they fire it. it will tear a hole
right through the galaxy.

69
00:08:41.167 --> 00:08:45.101
And I do not plan on seeing
a repeat of what happened to Bibin.

70
00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:47.934
We are going to settle the score.
no matter what it takes.

71
00:08:47.958 --> 00:08:51.583
Hmm. All ships. descend on Hy Izlan!

72
00:09:00.375 --> 00:09:02.541
It looks like it's still up to us.
after all.

73
00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.893
Kyber crystal status.

74
00:09:12.917 --> 00:09:14.375
Charging in progress.

75
00:09:17.125 --> 00:09:20.059
Weapons set up.
Calibrate and align kyber cannon.

76
00:09:20.083 --> 00:09:21.332
Roger.

77
00:09:33.208 --> 00:09:35.583
Destroy every last one of them!

78
00:09:51.333 --> 00:09:53.208
Huh?

79
00:09:56.625 --> 00:09:59.750
Enemy forces
have just infiltrated the control room.

80
00:10:00.458 --> 00:10:02.518
They are indeed tenacious.

81
00:10:02.542 --> 00:10:03.726
As a mark of respect.

82
00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.625
I think I shall
take care of them personally.

83
00:10:25.667 --> 00:10:29.434
So you have chosen to return.
Master Zhima?

84
00:10:29.458 --> 00:10:31.101
It would be irresponsible of me

85
00:10:31.125 --> 00:10:33.792
to allow the weight of your crimes
to grow any greater.

86
00:10:50.042 --> 00:10:51.309
What's wrong. Kara?

87
00:10:51.333 --> 00:10:54.208
My father and Nawaam
are fighting each other right now.

88
00:11:09.708 --> 00:11:11.268
Can you not see that your way

89
00:11:11.292 --> 00:11:14.684
only allows power-hungry fools
and criminals to flourish.

90
00:11:14.708 --> 00:11:17.143
while the average
good-natured individual suffers?

91
00:11:17.167 --> 00:11:19.351
Those who resist deserve to suffer.

92
00:11:19.375 --> 00:11:22.601
I have amassed enough power
to force every being to yield to me.

93
00:11:22.625 --> 00:11:23.809
You're wrong.

94
00:11:23.833 --> 00:11:27.167
You will never impose your will
on others by using strength alone.

95
00:11:29.875 --> 00:11:33.934
Fine. Master.
I am no longer in need of you.

96
00:11:33.958 --> 00:11:37.708
Nothing will stand in my way.
including you.

97
00:11:39.125 --> 00:11:41.167
Is there nothing that will sway you?

98
00:12:03.417 --> 00:12:04.417
Kara!

99
00:12:05.042 --> 00:12:06.417
Uh. my father...

100
00:12:17.542 --> 00:12:19.708
I never wanted to cross blades with you.

101
00:12:21.042 --> 00:12:22.875
So then you've been holding back.

102
00:12:23.542 --> 00:12:25.458
You underestimated me. didn't you?

103
00:12:35.875 --> 00:12:39.000
Ah. yes. You used that saber
to cut down your master.

104
00:12:40.458 --> 00:12:44.583
All right then.
show me what you're truly capable of.

105
00:13:07.292 --> 00:13:09.625
- Someone's coming!
- Hmm?

106
00:13:10.417 --> 00:13:11.417
Zhima?

107
00:13:34.583 --> 00:13:36.375
Nawaam...

108
00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.393
Let me guess.

109
00:13:41.417 --> 00:13:42.708
You were expecting Zhima?

110
00:13:43.875 --> 00:13:45.833
Father...

111
00:13:48.125 --> 00:13:51.268
I will not allow you
to destroy the kyber cannon.

112
00:13:51.292 --> 00:13:53.976
I'd sooner kill you all. like I did Zhima.

113
00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.434
You'll pay for that.

114
00:13:56.458 --> 00:14:00.833
Oh. your saber is also silver.
Interesting.

115
00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.500
Leave him to me.

116
00:14:03.125 --> 00:14:04.851
You go and secure the crystal.

117
00:14:04.875 --> 00:14:06.000
Kara! No!

118
00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:19.333
Ethan. we have to get to the cannon.

119
00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.351
There's nothing we can do to help her.

120
00:15:00.375 --> 00:15:01.542
She's on her own.

121
00:15:03.458 --> 00:15:06.374
Our job right now
is to destroy that cannon.

122
00:15:17.792 --> 00:15:21.351
You can now tame your emotions.

123
00:15:21.375 --> 00:15:24.726
Too bad you still
will not be able to defeat me.

124
00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:28.768
You're not bringing order to the galaxy
with any of the things you're doing.

125
00:15:28.792 --> 00:15:29.875
You're conquering it.

126
00:15:30.458 --> 00:15:31.893
And what's the difference?

127
00:15:31.917 --> 00:15:35.476
If you use domination to rule.
then the people will rebel.

128
00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:39.143
Leaders who control without compassion
are doomed to be overthrown.

129
00:15:39.167 --> 00:15:40.309
That's nonsense.

130
00:15:40.333 --> 00:15:42.518
It's sad.

131
00:15:42.542 --> 00:15:45.559
You were just a child
all alone with no one to teach you.

132
00:15:45.583 --> 00:15:47.000
Forced to make it on your own.

133
00:15:48.042 --> 00:15:50.518
Are you trying to tell me you pity me?

134
00:15:50.542 --> 00:15:51.542
That's not it.

135
00:15:52.458 --> 00:15:55.101
You say you've been attempting
to make your heart empty.

136
00:15:55.125 --> 00:15:58.393
But inside your heart was that little boy.

137
00:15:58.417 --> 00:16:00.667
And that is not a state of nothingness.

138
00:16:02.583 --> 00:16:03.583
How dare you?

139
00:16:10.583 --> 00:16:13.184
It's already halfway charged.

140
00:16:13.208 --> 00:16:16.250
How about the energy supply.
can't we just shut it off?

141
00:16:18.292 --> 00:16:20.833
If we can't hack
into their system.

142
00:16:22.083 --> 00:16:24.059
then we physically destroy the cannon.

143
00:16:24.083 --> 00:16:27.208
How are we supposed
to break a piece of junk that size?

144
00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.309
All right.

145
00:16:29.333 --> 00:16:33.082
If we can't damage the cannon.
then we have to destroy the kyber crystal!

146
00:16:34.542 --> 00:16:37.851
This is the great
and sacred crystal of Hy Izlan

147
00:16:37.875 --> 00:16:39.917
that Juro himself swore to protect.

148
00:16:42.042 --> 00:16:43.958
But we have no other choice.

149
00:17:19.583 --> 00:17:23.351
When my father cut down his master.
it was because he had no other choice.

150
00:17:23.375 --> 00:17:28.018
Afterwards. he gave up his blade.
so he wouldn't fall to the dark side.

151
00:17:28.042 --> 00:17:30.809
If you insist
on ruling over others like this.

152
00:17:30.833 --> 00:17:33.226
you will end up being consumed
by the dark side.

153
00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:37.518
Your notions of light and dark
are nothing but antiquated nonsense.

154
00:17:37.542 --> 00:17:41.624
Being bound by those distinctions
will never bring stability to the galaxy.

155
00:17:47.583 --> 00:17:49.958
There's no damage.

156
00:17:52.375 --> 00:17:53.375
No. wait!

157
00:18:17.042 --> 00:18:19.268
Did you forget
we're in the middle of something?

158
00:18:19.292 --> 00:18:21.226
Did you not see that just now?

159
00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.934
Do you have any idea
how many innocent people will die

160
00:18:23.958 --> 00:18:26.101
if you fire that cannon
even one more time?

161
00:18:26.125 --> 00:18:28.393
This is what makes the Jedi weak.

162
00:18:28.417 --> 00:18:29.476
Their limits.

163
00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:33.434
You should not let something such
as empathy distract you from your goals.

164
00:18:33.458 --> 00:18:35.309
no matter how many sacrifices are made.

165
00:18:35.333 --> 00:18:36.791
That isn't true!

166
00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:03.167
What just happened?

167
00:19:05.125 --> 00:19:07.434
What did I just do?

168
00:19:07.458 --> 00:19:09.393
I cut through him.

169
00:19:09.417 --> 00:19:11.792
But. he's still alive.

170
00:19:13.667 --> 00:19:15.667
<i>You didn't want
to kill anyone anymore.</i>

171
00:19:16.583 --> 00:19:17.583
<i>Isn't that right?</i>

172
00:19:19.375 --> 00:19:20.750
I see...

173
00:19:30.958 --> 00:19:34.393
So by your calculations. that was
only a fraction of its full power?

174
00:19:34.417 --> 00:19:37.101
Uh...

175
00:19:37.125 --> 00:19:39.625
We've got to do something
about this... fast.

176
00:19:47.125 --> 00:19:50.374
- What?
- It seems we can't even get close to it.

177
00:20:11.167 --> 00:20:12.167
Hmm.

178
00:20:15.542 --> 00:20:16.624
Wretched thing!

179
00:20:33.708 --> 00:20:35.750
What is this I'm seeing?

180
00:21:30.917 --> 00:21:33.101
How is this possible?

181
00:21:33.125 --> 00:21:34.792
How is your saber green?

182
00:21:36.125 --> 00:21:39.875
You would abandon the state of nothingness
for the path of the Jedi?

183
00:21:41.125 --> 00:21:42.309
Don't you see?

184
00:21:42.333 --> 00:21:44.809
The Jedi aren't capable
of even their own cause!

185
00:21:44.833 --> 00:21:49.000
This saber is merely responding
to what is inside my heart.

186
00:21:50.292 --> 00:21:53.667
You'll sacrifice countless lives
to achieve your vision.

187
00:21:55.042 --> 00:21:56.667
And that is evil.

188
00:21:57.375 --> 00:22:00.393
Good and evil are no different in the end.

189
00:22:00.417 --> 00:22:02.351
They're two halves of the same whole.

190
00:22:02.375 --> 00:22:04.874
Unless you accept both. you will be lost.

191
00:22:11.208 --> 00:22:12.625
Uh...

192
00:22:14.833 --> 00:22:18.042
Your blade is showing you
what the color of your heart is now.

193
00:23:04.875 --> 00:23:05.875
Father...

194
00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:19.750
Hmm.

195
00:23:45.667 --> 00:23:47.417
<i>How am I not dead?</i>

196
00:23:48.792 --> 00:23:51.875
<i>No. wait. I am dead. after all.</i>

197
00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:13.851
<i>She used the Force
to shut off the lightsaber's blade.</i>

198
00:24:13.875 --> 00:24:14.875
<i>Impossible.</i>

199
00:24:16.625 --> 00:24:20.708
<i>Kara has reached a point far
beyond what you and I have ever attained.</i>

200
00:24:23.792 --> 00:24:25.167
I was defeated.

201
00:24:37.625 --> 00:24:40.124
Break!

202
00:24:48.667 --> 00:24:50.250
Fire.

203
00:24:54.750 --> 00:24:56.707
Uh...

204
00:25:33.333 --> 00:25:36.226
The kyber cannon
has been destroyed.

205
00:25:36.250 --> 00:25:38.458
The fortress engines have been destroyed.

206
00:25:39.417 --> 00:25:42.292
Communications system
will be shut down shortly.

207
00:25:43.958 --> 00:25:45.434
What happened. where's Nawaam?

208
00:25:45.458 --> 00:25:47.916
Presumed eliminated by a Jedi.

209
00:25:49.958 --> 00:25:52.292
Oh...

210
00:26:15.958 --> 00:26:18.916
<i>You did it. Kara.
You've come so far.</i>

211
00:26:20.583 --> 00:26:21.583
Father?

212
00:26:28.333 --> 00:26:31.500
In the end. it turns out
his heart wasn't empty after all.

213
00:26:35.542 --> 00:26:39.082
- Hey. Kara!
- Huh?
